---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import DocsNav from '../components/DocsNav.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---
<Layout title="Documentation · Nevermind">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>Documentation</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="docs-layout">
    <nav class="docs-sidebar" aria-label="Docs navigation">
      <DocsNav current="guide" />
      <span class="docs-sidebar__section">On this page</span>
      <a href="#install">Install</a>
      <a href="#palette">The palette</a>
      <a href="#extensions">Extensions</a>
      <a href="#api">API access</a>
    </nav>

    <article class="docs-article">
      <h2 id="install">Install</h2>
      <p>Download Nevermind from <a href="https://github.com/pablopunk/nvm/releases">GitHub Releases</a>.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>macOS</strong>: <code>.zip</code> (Apple Silicon or Intel)</li>
        <li><strong>Windows</strong>: <code>.exe</code> installer or portable</li>
        <li><strong>Linux</strong>: <code>.AppImage</code> or <code>.deb</code></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="palette">The palette</h2>
      <p>Open Nevermind from its app icon, or set an optional global shortcut, then type. It finds apps, files, clipboard history, and commands. Sign in with <strong>Log in to Nevermind</strong>, or configure your own AI key, to use the AI builder.</p>
      <p><kbd>Cmd+K</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+K</kbd> shows actions for the selected item. Search for <strong>Keyboard Shortcuts</strong> to view or change shortcuts. See <a href="/docs/features">Built-in features</a>.</p>

      <h2 id="extensions">Extensions</h2>
      <p>Describe a tool in the palette and the AI builder writes it, or write a TypeScript file yourself in <code>~/.config/nevermind/extensions</code>.</p>
      <p>Extensions declare capabilities for review only. An enabled extension has full local access, so enable only code you trust.</p>

      <h2 id="api">API access</h2>
      <p>Create a token on your <a href="/profile">profile</a> and send it as a Bearer header to the OpenAI-compatible endpoint.</p>
      <pre><code>curl -sS https://api.nvm.fyi/api/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer nvm_pat_YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -d '&#123;"model":"nevermind","messages":[&#123;"role":"user","content":"Hello"&#125;]&#125;'</code></pre>
      <table class="table">
        <thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>401</code></td><td>Missing, invalid, or revoked token</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>402</code></td><td>Insufficient credits for the request</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>429</code></td><td>Rate limited; check <code>Retry-After</code> if present</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
